     1,
     "<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\">Hi all,<div><br></div><div><div>I notice that some of you have a nice visual format for displaying code when you email people with your code suggestions. (Looks like the verbatim latex environment and some nice blue boxes as well). How do you achieve this?</div><div><br></div><div>Thanks!</div><div>Mike<br><div><div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\"><div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\"><div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\"></div></div></div></div></div><div>\r\n<div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;word-wrap:break-word\"><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;word-wrap:break-word\"><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;word-wrap:break-word\"><div><br>--</div><div>Michael Koontz — <a href=\"http://michaeljkoontz.weebly.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://michaeljkoontz.weebly.com/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792468461510000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3ihRROkT8L7u94yORolG0z\">website</a></div><div>Graduate Group in Ecology</div><div><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Plant+and+Environmental+Sciences+Bldg,+University+of+California,+Davis,+Davis,+CA+95616/@38.5427751,-121.7570251,16z/data=!4m2!3m1!1s0x808529085c693a13:0xe20b0046ee4eb4f7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.google.com/maps/place/Plant%2Band%2BEnvironmental%2BSciences%2BBldg,%2BUniversity%2Bof%2BCalifornia,%2BDavis,%2BDavis,%2BCA%2B95616/@38.5427751,-121.7570251,16z/data%3D!4m2!3m1!1s0x808529085c693a13:0xe20b00